WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.250 --> 00:00:06.675
Connect the message to a measurable customer journey: multi-channel launch.

2
00:00:06.675 --> 00:00:13.474
Use an AI assistant to explore ideas, then choose a specific audience, offer, and experiment.

3
00:00:13.874 --> 00:00:18.072
Use ChatGPT to develop distinct messages for one audience.

4
00:00:18.072 --> 00:00:23.934
Build the creative variants in Figma and connect them to clean HubSpot segments.

5
00:00:23.934 --> 00:00:27.335
Keep the campaign naming and offer consistent.

6
00:00:27.735 --> 00:00:32.884
In Google Analytics, inspect the acquisition channel and conversion event.

7
00:00:32.884 --> 00:00:41.303
Connect the review loop in n eight n, then compare cost and response in Looker Studio before deciding what to test next.

8
00:00:41.703 --> 00:00:44.646
Bring those signals into campaign dashboard.

9
00:00:44.646 --> 00:00:48.459
Show what changed, what it means, and what to test next.

10
00:00:48.459 --> 00:00:52.807
Creative production and measurement work as one continuous loop.
